0 0 0 rg
0.99 0.96 0.94 rg 0.80 0.30 0.10 RG 0.80 w 50.0 310.5 495.0 50.0 re B
0.80 0.30 0.10 RG 2.50 w 50.0 310.5 m 50.0 360.5 l S
0.70 0.15 0.05 rg BT /FB 8.5 Tf 58.0 348.5 Td (Limitation: Teacher Bias Entrenchment via Hard-Target Supervision) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /FR 8.0 Tf 58.0 336.5 Td (Because sequence distillation trains on the teacher's argmax token sequence only, the student receives zero signal regarding) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.0 Tf 58.0 325.5 Td (the teacher's uncertainty over alternative plausible outputs. If phi3.5 produces a slot hallucination with 51% confidence) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.0 Tf 58.0 314.5 Td (\(e.g., 'paris' for a command that never mentions a city\), the student learns this error as 100% ground truth, amplifying) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.0 Tf 58.0 303.5 Td (and entrenching the teacher's systematic biases. Logit-based KD would convey the teacher's uncertainty but is infeasible here.) Tj ET

