BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 524.5 Td (On container startup, the lifespan context manager immediately marks the pod as alive \(/healthz = 200\) but) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 513.0 Td (not ready \(/readyz = 503\). It then connects to SeaweedFS, paginates the S3 bucket under MODEL_URI,) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 501.5 Td (downloads all model files to /app/model, and loads them into memory via Hugging Face AutoModelForCausalLM.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 490.0 Td (Only after successful model.eval\(\) does it flip state[ready] = True, enabling /readyz to return 200 and) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 478.5 Td (allowing Traefik Ingress to route traffic to the pod. This prevents any 502 Bad Gateway errors during cold) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 467.0 Td (starts or rolling updates.) Tj ET
