BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 419.5 Td (validator confirms: \(a\) the string parses as valid JSON, \(b\) the parsed object contains exactly the keys) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 408.0 Td ({intent, date, time, place}, \(c\) intent is one of the 8 enumerated values, and \(d\) slot values are either) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 396.5 Td (null or strings. Any validation failure causes a HTTP 500 response with body {error: invalid_model_output}.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 385.0 Td (When FAULT_INJECT=1, the generated text is overwritten with 'not json' before validation, guaranteeing a) Tj ET
