0 0 0 rg
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 375.5 Td (Unlike stateful firewalls \(e.g. AWS Security Groups, iptables conntrack\), a Network ACL is completely) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 364.0 Td (stateless - it maintains no connection state table. Each packet is inspected in isolation. When a client OS) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.5 Tf 50.0 352.5 Td (sends a TCP SYN to port 443, the inbound Rule 210 permits it. However, the server's HTTP response travels) Tj ET
